Subject: Data package only Suggested (free packages never depend on licensed
 ones)

Debian's opentyrian Depends on tyrian-data | game-data-packager. Our tyrian-data (gamedb/games/opentyrian/licensed/tyrian-data/tyrian-data.sh,
Section local/games: the freeware Tyrian 2.1 under Epic's limited-use license) lives in the
ps3-licensed suite, and a free package must not Depend or Recommend a licensed one
(docs/PACKAGING.md, "Game data"). Both become Suggests; the engine tells the user what is missing.

diff --git a/debian/control b/debian/control
--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -16,9 +16,11 @@ X-Style: black
 Package: opentyrian
 Architecture: any
 Depends:
- tyrian-data | game-data-packager,
  ${misc:Depends},
  ${shlibs:Depends},
+Suggests:
+ tyrian-data,
+ game-data-packager,
 Description: open-source port of the DOS shoot-em-up Tyrian
